{"meta": {"9781419782701": {"pub_date": "2026-10-20", "publisher_us": "Amulet Books", "description": "When the going gets tough, what's a wimpy kid to do? In Fight or Flight, Greg Heffley faces his biggest challenge yet as he becomes a target for the school bully. Luckily for Greg, his best friend, Rowley Jefferson, takes karate, so at least Greg's got someone in his corner. But an unexpected twist makes Greg realize he's facing an uphill battle. Will Greg step into the ring or throw in the towel?", "image": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=9AvU0QEACAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api"}, "9780545791441": {"pub_date": "2026", "publisher_us": null, "description": "", "image": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=GyXZ0QEACAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api"}, "9781728235202": {"pub_date": "2021-08-03", "publisher_us": "Sourcebooks Jabberwocky", "description": "Perfect for fans of Fletcher and the Falling Leaves, The Leaf Thiefis a funny picture book that teaches kids about autumn, adapting to change, and the seasons. Squirrel loves counting the leaves on his tree--red leaves, gold leaves, orange, and more. But hold on! One of his leaves is missing! On a quest to find the missing leaf, Squirrel teams up with his good friend Bird to discover who the leaf ", "image": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=jtr6zQEACAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api"}, "9780805047905": {"pub_date": "1996-09-15", "publisher_us": "Macmillan", "description": "A pictorial representation of a question and answer game played by a teacher and her group.", "image": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=xPLEOdPDQVYC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"}, "9781558585362": {"pub_date": "1996", "publisher_us": "North South Books", "description": "The most beautiful fish in the entire ocean discovers the real value of personal beauty and friendship. On board pages.", "image": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=Poi1ngEACAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api"}, "9781589255517": {"pub_date": "2015-03-03", "publisher_us": "Tiger Tales", "description": "Show your child just how strong your love is every minute of the day! Features a \"To\" and \"From\" personalization page, making this sweet board book an ideal gift for baby showers, birthdays, and new parents. The sun rises, and a bear and cub begin their day together. They splash in the water, climb mountains, watch the colorful lights in the shimmering sky, and play with friends. They show their l", "image": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=cv1OEAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"}, "9780547199450": {"pub_date": "2011", "publisher_us": "Houghton Mifflin Harcourt", "description": "Presents a tribute to the creator of the giant balloons that fill the sky during the Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade, tracing the work of artist Tony Sarg, whose innovative \"upside-down puppet\" creations have become the parade's trademark.", "image": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=xJKXngEACAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api"}, "9781546199359": {"pub_date": "2026-11-03", "publisher_us": "Graphix", "description": "An all-new adventure from the #1 global bestselling Dog Man phenomenon coming November 3, 2026! In the newest saga, our anti-hero, Grandpa, alters the fabric of time and space. Is his evil the necessary soil for Dog Man and friends to grow and bloom? Can we all step up to be the change? It's the saga of the century -- Dog Man: A Sprinkle in Time!", "image": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=Yw7f0QEACAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api"}, "9780694003617": {"pub_date": "1991-08-02", "publisher_us": "Harper Collins", "description": "In a great green room, tucked away in bed, is a little bunny. \"Goodnight room, goodnight moon.\" And to all the familiar things in the softly lit room--to the picture of the three little bears sitting 